Connectome data
---------------
data/malecns-v1.0-gf-escape-subgraph.json is an aggregate derived from the
MaleCNS v1.0 connectome release (FlyEM project team at HHMI Janelia Research
Campus, the University of Cambridge Department of Zoology, the MRC Laboratory of
Molecular Biology and Google Research). The MaleCNS dataset is licensed under
CC-BY. Cite:

  Berg S, Beckett IR, Costa M, Schlegel P, Januszewski M, et al. Sexual
  dimorphism in the complete Drosophila male central nervous system connectome.
  Cell (2026). doi:10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015

Differentiable logic gate networks
----------------------------------
c3s/dlgn.py is an independent implementation of the method described in:

  Petersen F, Borgelt C, Kuehne H, Deussen O. Deep Differentiable Logic Gate
  Networks. NeurIPS 2022. arXiv:2210.08277

No code from the authors' reference implementation (difflogic, MIT License) is
included. The difflogic README states "Patent pending". An independent
implementation does not remove any patent rights that may exist in the method;
check the current status before commercial use.

ABC and Yosys
-------------
The synthesis step invokes ABC (Berkeley Logic Synthesis and Verification Group)
as an external program, as distributed with Yosys. Neither is bundled.

forge-std
---------
The Foundry test suite uses forge-std (MIT/Apache-2.0), installed into
contracts/lib at test time and not committed.

TapeOut netlist layout
----------------------
The netlist byte layout and tick semantics implemented in c3s/netlist.py were
cross-checked against the publicly served tapeout.net web application. No code
from that application is included in this repository.
